<Row ss:Height="28"><Cell ss:StyleID="TT" ss:MergeAcross="4"><Data ss:Type="String">CloudFuze  |  POC Scope, Testing &amp; Customisation Register</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="16"><Cell ss:StyleID="ST" ss:MergeAcross="4"><Data ss:Type="String">Complete this sheet for every POC. Fill all sections, then upload the completed file to the POC project in the PMO system.</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="8"><Cell ss:StyleID="SP" ss:MergeAcross="4"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
